# Canonical host is https://www.oarandblade.com (matches <link rel="canonical">,
# robots.txt, sitemap.xml and all Open Graph tags) — send every other host/scheme
# variant there with a permanent redirect so Google consolidates link equity onto
# a single URL instead of treating www/non-www/http as duplicate content.
# Requires both oarandblade.com and www.oarandblade.com to be added as domains
# on this site in the hosting dashboard, with DNS pointed at this deploy.
http://oarandblade.com/*      https://www.oarandblade.com/:splat  301!
http://www.oarandblade.com/*  https://www.oarandblade.com/:splat  301!
https://oarandblade.com/*     https://www.oarandblade.com/:splat  301!

# Catch-all — serve index.html for any unknown path (SPA fallback)
/* /index.html 200
